import org.mindrot.jbcrypt.BCrypt;

public boolean authenticate(String inputPassword, User user) {
    String storedHash = user.getPasswordHash(); // bcrypt hash
    return BCrypt.checkpw(inputPassword, storedHash);
}


flaw
This suggests passwords are stored in plaintext and compared directly. 

why this fixes
Stores passwords as bcrypt hashes, not plaintext.

Uses a library to verify passwords safely.
